  "description": "Provides boiler plate code and classes for projects that feature a Domain Driven Design (DDD) architecture:\n*) An ObjectFactory and an AspectProxy that features Aspect Oriented Programming (AOP) and Dependency Injection.\n*) For the Data Access Layer (DAL) there is a general Data Access Object (DAO) that features loading data from any kind of underlying storage into Data Objects (DO) for further use.\n*) Remoting servers and clients to implemented remoted calls with very little communication management.",
